OL,3,GNEWSAThree sisters who drowned in sea
OL,4,Aoff Brighton took own lives, inquest
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree sisters who drowned in the sea
OL,8,Foff Brighton took their own lives, a
OL,9,Fcoroner has ruled.
OL,11,FJane Adetoro, 36, Christina Walters,
OL,12,F32, and Rebecca Walters, 31, who had
OL,13,Fall been living together in Greenford,
OL,14,FLondon, died on 13 May.
OL,16,FOn 11 May, the sisters had visited an
OL,17,Farea of Birmingham close to where their
OL,18,Fmother had drowned in 2010. They then
OL,19,Ftravelled to Brighton.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
